    "chapter": 3,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我们在哪儿见面\n\n丽丽：本，我们明天一起去看球吧！\n本：好啊！我们在哪儿见面？\n丽丽：明天5点，在学校旁边的车站，怎么样？\n本：那个时间车站人很多。\n丽丽：那我们就在车站旁边的咖啡店见面吧！\n本：好的。",
    "traditional": "我們在哪兒見面\n\n麗麗：本，我們明天一起去看球吧！\n本：好啊！我們在哪兒見面？\n麗麗：明天5點，在學校旁邊的車站，怎麼樣？\n本：那個時間車站人很多。\n麗麗：那我們就在車站旁邊的咖啡店見面吧！\n本：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Where Should We Meet"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：本，我们明天一起去看球吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：本，我們明天一起去看球吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì běn wǒ men míng tiān yì qǐ qù kàn qiú ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ben, let’s go watch football together tomorrow!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：好啊！我们在哪儿见面？",
      "traditional": "本：好啊！我們在哪兒見面？",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo a wǒ men zài nǎ'r jiàn miàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Sure! Where should we meet?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：明天5点，在学校旁边的车站，怎么样？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：明天5點，在學校旁邊的車站，怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì míng tiān 1 diǎn zài xué xiào páng biān de chē zhàn zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Tomorrow at 5, how about meeting at the train station next to the school?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：那个时间车站人很多。",
      "traditional": "本：那個時間車站人很多。",
      "pinyin": "běn nà ge shí jiān chē zhàn rén hěn duō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: There are a lot of people at the train station at that time."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那我们就在车站旁边的咖啡店见面吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那我們就在車站旁邊的咖啡店見面吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà wǒ men jiù zài chē zhàn páng biān de kā fēi diàn jiàn miàn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Then let’s meet at the coffee shop next to the station!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：好的。",
      "traditional": "本：好的。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok."
    }
  ],
